 "subtitles": [
  {
   "id": "sub-1",
   "localStart": 0,
   "localDuration": 3.093,
   "text": "所以，认真对待接下来这件事。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-2",
   "localStart": 3.237,
   "localDuration": 1.5,
   "text": "关掉所有标签页。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-3",
   "localStart": 4.737,
   "localDuration": 1.688,
   "text": "打开一个空白文档。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-4",
   "localStart": 6.425,
   "localDuration": 2.25,
   "text": "定一个十五分钟的计时器。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-5",
   "localStart": 8.817,
   "localDuration": 3.209,
   "text": "下面每个问题，都用笔写下答案。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-6",
   "localStart": 12.026,
   "localDuration": 2.995,
   "text": "越让你不舒服的，越不要跳过。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-7",
   "localStart": 15.189,
   "localDuration": 2.535,
   "text": "第一步，挖出你的原材料。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-8",
   "localStart": 17.889,
   "localDuration": 1.467,
   "text": "问自己三个问题。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-9",
   "localStart": 19.509,
   "localDuration": 4.747,
   "text": "第一，有什么东西，你懂得多到不可能是偶然？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-10",
   "localStart": 24.256,
   "localDuration": 7.007,
   "text": "哪个话题，你跨了几十个来源、研究了好几年，却没人付过你一分钱？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-11",
   "localStart": 31.425,
   "localDuration": 5.381,
   "text": "第二，有什么问题，你自己解决了，还以为别人早就会了？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-12",
   "localStart": 36.806,
   "localDuration": 4.968,
   "text": "有什么对你来说天经地义、却好像难倒了所有人的事？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-13",
   "localStart": 41.937,
   "localDuration": 5.4,
   "text": "第三，你小时候因为什么被骂，但那其实是一种很早的品味？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-14",
   "localStart": 47.337,
   "localDuration": 3.8,
   "text": "你在被人说\"不实用\"之前，痴迷过什么？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-15",
   "localStart": 51.297,
   "localDuration": 1.646,
   "text": "写完，圈出一个。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-16",
   "localStart": 52.943,
   "localDuration": 2.881,
   "text": "那个让你心里动了一下的答案。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-17",
   "localStart": 55.824,
   "localDuration": 1.851,
   "text": "那就是你的原材料。"
  }
 ]
}